# Pages Router conventions

Full reference: `.cursor/PROJECT-OVERVIEW.md`

This project uses **Pages Router** — one route at `/`.

## Entry files

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `src/pages/_document.tsx` | HTML shell, `suppressHydrationWarning` on `<html>` / `<body>` |
| `src/pages/_app.tsx` | Global styles, fonts, `Head`, `AppProviders` |
| `src/pages/index.tsx` | Thin wrapper → `<WorkforceActivity />` |

## Providers (`src/providers/AppProviders.tsx`)

Client component:

```txt
AppThemeProvider → ActivityProvider → children
```

## Rules

- Pages stay thin — render feature module root only
- View switching happens inside `WorkforceActivity` via context (not URL routes)
- Mark client boundaries with `'use client'` on components using hooks/context

## Do NOT

- Add `src/app/` (App Router) — conflicts with Pages Router
- Put business logic in `_app.tsx` or `index.tsx`
- Fetch from APIs in page files
